{"attributes":{"description":"SOC Lab – Baseline Comparison Dashboard\n\nCompare current authentication and event activity against typical volume to identify anomalies.\nUse this dashboard over a 24-hour or 7-day window to establish a visual baseline.\n\nHow to use:\n  - Set time range to Last 24 hours for daily comparison\n  - Switch to Last 7 days to see weekly patterns\n  - High spikes in auth failures relative to the hourly baseline indicate spray/brute force activity\n  - Users appearing consistently at top of the failures table may warrant account review\n\nImport instructions:\n  Kibana → Stack Management → Saved Objects → Import → select this file","hits":0,"kibanaSavedObjectMeta":{"searchSourceJSON":"{\"query\":{\"language\":\"kuery\",\"query\":\"\"},\"filter\":[]}"},"optionsJSON":"{\"useMargins\":true,\"syncColors\":false,\"hidePanelTitles\":false}","panelsJSON":"[{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"w\":36,\"h\":15,\"i\":\"panel-0\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-0\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_0\"},{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":36,\"y\":0,\"w\":12,\"h\":15,\"i\":\"panel-1\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-1\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_1\"},{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":15,\"w\":48,\"h\":15,\"i\":\"panel-2\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-2\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_2\"},{\"version\":\"8.11.1\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"gridData\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":30,\"w\":24,\"h\":12,\"i\":\"panel-3\"},\"panelIndex\":\"panel-3\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"enhancements\":{}},\"panelRefName\":\"panel_3\"}]","refreshInterval":{"pause":false,"value":30000},"timeFrom":"now-24h","timeTo":"now","timeRestore":true,"title":"SOC Lab – Baseline Comparison","version":1},"id":"dashboard-baseline-comparison","migrationVersion":{"dashboard":"8.9.0"},"r